sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(227,242,253) Public Zone
    participant B as Cockpit inbox
  end
  box rgb(224,242,241) Hosts
    participant L as Loans host
    participant K as KYC host
    participant C as Cards host
  end
  box rgb(255,248,225) Host databases
    participant DB as pre_task, each host its own
  end
  Note over B: every 30 s with jitter while the tab is visible, paused when hidden
  par in parallel, 5 s timeout each
    B->>L: GET /tasks?assignment=mine,candidate&limit=50, If-None-Match
    rect rgb(255,248,225)
      Note over L,DB: Read-only TX, partial index ranges, LIMIT 51
      L->>DB: bounded query
    end
    alt page unchanged
      L-->>B: 304
    else changed
      L-->>B: 200, 50 tasks, nextCursor, ETag
    end
  and
    B->>K: same request
    K-->>B: 200, 12 tasks, no nextCursor
  and
    B->>C: same request
    C--xB: timeout
  end
  B->>B: k-way merge by dueAt, then host id, then task id
  B->>B: show items up to the smallest frontier of hosts that have more pages
  B->>B: banner: Cards host unreachable, list incomplete
  B->>L: Load more: next page only from hosts at the frontier
